<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FAF7F2" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1E1B18" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
  <meta name="description" content="FamilyLedger brings bank transactions, receipts, email purchases, cash, and family spending into one calm view." />
  <link rel="icon" href="data:," />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <title>FamilyLedger — A calmer way to know your money</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --bg: #FAF7F2;
      --surface: #FFFDF9;
      --surface-2: #F4EEE6;
      --ink: #3F3A36;
      --muted: #716A63;
      --faint: #9B9288;
      --line: #E8DFD4;
      --primary: #C87C5A;
      --primary-strong: #A95F42;
      --primary-soft: #F3D9CB;
      --sage: #6E8E6A;
      --sage-soft: #DCE8D8;
      --gold: #D49A45;
      --sky: #6D91A8;
      --shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(85, 61, 45, .13);
      --phone-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(53, 40, 31, .24);
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #1E1B18;
        --surface: #292520;
        --surface-2: #332D27;
        --ink: #F7F0E8;
        --muted: #C9BFB5;
        --faint: #A4978A;
        --line: #443B33;
        --primary: #E39A77;
        --primary-strong: #F1B091;
        --primary-soft: #53372B;
        --sage: #91B28B;
        --sage-soft: #30432E;
        --gold: #E0AE60;
        --sky: #8CB3C9;
        --shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28);
        --phone-shadow: 0 32px 78px rgba(0, 0, 0, .48);
      }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    button, a { font: inherit; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button { color: inherit; }
    svg { display: block; }
    .container { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .skip-link {
      position: fixed; left: 16px; top: -80px; z-index: 100;
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .skip-link:focus { top: 16px; }
    .site-nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 75%, transparent);
    }
    .nav-inner { min-height: 68px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 28px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px;
      border: 0; border-radius: 999px; min-height: 46px; padding: 0 20px;
      text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    }
    .button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
    .button-primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
    .button-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-strong); }
    .button-quiet { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .button-quiet:hover { background: var(--surface); }
    .mobile-menu { display: none; background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 10px; cursor: pointer; }

    .hero {
      min-height: 780px;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(480px, 1.1fr);
      align-items: center; gap: 42px; padding: 70px 0 90px;
    }
    .hero-copy { max-width: 620px; }
    .status-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: var(--sage); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .status-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sage); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--sage-soft); }
    h1, h2, h3 { margin: 0; }
    h1 {
      font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-size: clamp(54px, 7vw, 88px);
      line-height: .98; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.04em; max-width: 760px;
    }
    .hero-lede { margin: 28px 0 30px; font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px); color: var(--muted); max-width: 610px; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-note { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--faint); font-size: 13px; }
    .hero-visual { position: relative; min-height: 620px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
    .hero-visual::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 7% 3% 6%; border-radius: 48% 52% 50% 50%;
      background: var(--primary-soft); opacity: .65; transform: rotate(-6deg);
    }
    .orbit-chip {
      position: absolute; z-index: 4; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 15px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .orbit-chip svg { color: var(--primary); }
    .chip-receipt { left: 0; top: 20%; }
    .chip-bank { right: 0; top: 33%; }
    .chip-family { left: 4%; bottom: 16%; }

    .phone {
      position: relative; z-index: 3; width: 286px; padding: 8px; border-radius: 38px;
      background: #2B2927; box-shadow: var(--phone-shadow); border: 1px solid #403C38;
    }
    .phone-screen {
      position: relative; aspect-ratio: 9 / 20; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 31px;
      background: #F8F5F0;
    }
    .phone-screen img {
      display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    }
    .hero-phone { transform: rotate(4deg); }

    section { scroll-margin-top: 78px; }
    .trust-strip { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
    .trust-grid { min-height: 108px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); align-items: center; }
    .trust-item { padding: 0 26px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .trust-item:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
    .trust-item:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .trust-item strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; }
    .trust-item span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

    .section-shell { padding: 110px 0; }
    .section-heading { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .eyebrow { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    h2 { font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 62px); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .section-heading p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; margin: 18px 0 0; max-width: 620px; }

    .phone-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; align-items: start; }
    .screen-card { min-width: 0; }
    .screen-label { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .screen-number { color: var(--primary); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
    .screen-label h3 { font-size: 19px; margin-top: 3px; }
    .screen-label p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 7px 0 0; }
    .phone-wrap {
      min-height: 590px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 26px 10px;
      background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 28px 28px 14px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .phone-wrap .phone { width: min(100%, 250px); }

    .flow-section { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .flow-section { background: #F0E7DD; color: #302B27; } }
    .flow-section .section-heading p { color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 68%, transparent); }
    .flow-section .eyebrow { color: #F3B89D; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .flow-section .eyebrow { color: #A95F42; } }
    .capture-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 20%, transparent); }
    .capture-item { background: var(--ink); padding: 38px 30px; min-height: 240px; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .capture-item { background: #F0E7DD; } }
    .capture-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; margin-bottom: 36px; color: #F3B89D; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .capture-icon { color: #A95F42; } }
    .capture-item h3 { font-size: 20px; }
    .capture-item p { margin: 10px 0 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 68%, transparent); font-size: 14px; }

    .family-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr; gap: 70px; align-items: center; }
    .family-copy p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
    .feature-list { display: grid; gap: 0; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 19px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature-row svg { color: var(--primary); }
    .feature-row strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; }
    .feature-row span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .family-board { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 32px; border-radius: 30px 10px 30px 10px; }
    .family-board-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .family-board-head span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .member-stack { display: flex; }
    .member { width: 38px; height: 38px; margin-left: -8px; border: 3px solid var(--surface); border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; }
    .member:first-child { margin-left: 0; background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--primary-strong); }
    .member:nth-child(2) { background: var(--sage-soft); color: var(--sage); }
    .family-chart { height: 180px; display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 10px; padding-top: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .bar { flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: var(--primary-soft); border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; position: relative; }
    .bar:nth-child(2n) { background: var(--sage-soft); }
    .bar span { position: absolute; bottom: -24px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }
    .family-legend { display: flex; gap: 18px; margin-top: 42px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .legend-dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 6px; background: var(--primary); }
    .legend-dot.sage { background: var(--sage); }

    .security { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--surface-2); }
    .security-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 60px; align-items: start; }
    .security-title h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 54px); }
    .security-title p { color: var(--muted); }
    .security-points { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px 34px; }
    .security-point { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 16px; }
    .security-point h3 { font-size: 15px; }
    .security-point p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 8px 0 0; }

    .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: stretch; }
    .plan { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .plan.featured { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-10px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .plan.featured { background: #F0E7DD; color: #302B27; border-color: #F0E7DD; } }
    .plan-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; }
    .plan-price { margin: 18px 0 24px; font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1; }
    .plan-price span { font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; opacity: .66; }
    .plan ul { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 28px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 13px; font-size: 13px; }
    .plan li { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .plan li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--sage); font-weight: 800; }
    .plan .button { margin-top: auto; }
    .plan.featured .button { background: var(--primary); color: white; border-color: transparent; }
    .pricing-note { color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 18px; }

    .cta-band { padding: 44px 0 80px; }
    .cta-inner { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 58px; border-radius: 32px 8px 32px 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; }
    .cta-inner h2 { font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 52px); max-width: 620px; }
    .cta-inner p { margin: 12px 0 0; opacity: .86; }
    .cta-inner .button { background: white; color: #7A452F; white-space: nowrap; }

    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 30px 0 max(30px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 30px; align-items: start; }
    .footer-copy { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; max-width: 560px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
    .footer-links a, .footer-links button { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; }
    .footer-links a:hover, .footer-links button:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .copy-status { min-height: 20px; color: var(--sage); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }

    .policy { padding: 40px 0 90px; }
    .policy details { background: var(--surface); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .policy summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 20px 0; font-weight: 800; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .policy summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .policy summary::after { content: "+"; color: var(--primary); font-size: 21px; line-height: 1; }
    .policy details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
    .policy-content { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; max-width: 850px; padding-bottom: 24px; }
    .policy-content h3 { color: var(--ink); font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0 7px; }
    .policy-content p { margin: 0; }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 80px; text-align: center; }
      .hero-copy { margin-inline: auto; }
      .status-line, .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
      .hero-lede { margin-inline: auto; }
      .hero-visual { min-height: 610px; }
      .phone-gallery { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); max-width: 620px; margin-inline: auto; gap: 42px 20px; }
      .phone-wrap { min-height: 590px; }
      .family-layout, .security-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 46px; }
      .trust-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding: 18px 0; }
      .trust-item { border-right: 0; padding: 16px 22px; }
      .trust-item:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 620px; margin-inline: auto; }
      .plan.featured { transform: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px); }
      .site-nav { position: sticky; }
      .nav-inner { min-height: 58px; }
      .mobile-menu { display: grid; place-items: center; }
      .nav-links { position: absolute; display: none; top: 58px; left: 14px; right: 14px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow); align-items: stretch; }
      .nav-links.open { display: grid; }
      .nav-links .button { width: 100%; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 58px 0 70px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(50px, 17vw, 72px); }
      .hero-lede { font-size: 17px; }
      .hero-visual { min-height: 590px; transform: scale(.92); margin: -20px -22px; }
      .orbit-chip { padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 11px; }
      .chip-receipt { left: 0; }.chip-bank { right: 0; }.chip-family { left: 1%; }
      .trust-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .trust-item, .trust-item:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 18px 0; }
      .trust-item:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
      .section-shell { padding: 80px 0; }
      .phone-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 360px; gap: 42px; }
      .section-heading { margin-bottom: 38px; }
      h2 { font-size: 42px; }
      .section-heading p { font-size: 16px; }
      .capture-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .capture-item { min-height: 190px; padding: 28px 24px; }
      .capture-icon { margin-bottom: 25px; }
      .family-board { padding: 24px 18px; }
      .security-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .pricing-grid { gap: 12px; }
      .cta-inner { padding: 40px 24px; display: block; }
      .cta-inner .button { margin-top: 24px; width: 100%; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-links { justify-content: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .hero-phone { animation: settle 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes settle { 0%,100% { transform: rotate(4deg) translateY(0); } 50% { transform: rotate(3deg) translateY(-8px); } }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-nav">
    <nav class="container nav-inner" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <button class="mobile-menu" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </button>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#preview">Preview</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#plans">Plans</a>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#beta">Join the beta</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <div class="container hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="status-line"><span class="status-dot"></span>Private beta for Android</div>
        <h1>Every dollar,<br>in its place.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">FamilyLedger brings bank activity, receipts, email purchases, cash, and family spending into one clear view—without turning money into homework.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#beta">Request beta access
            <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="button button-quiet" href="#preview">Explore the app</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">Designed for US accounts and USD. Bank availability varies by institution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="FamilyLedger summary screen preview">
        <div class="orbit-chip chip-receipt">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2V3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          Receipt scan
        </div>
        <div class="orbit-chip chip-bank">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 9 9-5 9 5M5 10v7M9.5 10v7M14.5 10v7M19 10v7M3 20h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Bank sync
        </div>
        <div class="orbit-chip chip-family">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9.5 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8ZM17 11a3 3 0 0 0 0-6M21 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          Family view
        </div>
        <div class="phone hero-phone">
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="FamilyLedger Android app summary screen showing total balance, monthly spending, and recent expenses" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-strip">
      <div class="container trust-grid">
        <div class="trust-item"><strong>3 ways in</strong><span>Bank, receipt, or email</span></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><strong>One clean ledger</strong><span>Duplicates linked, not counted twice</span></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><strong>Family-ready</strong><span>Shared spending, distinct colors</span></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><strong>You stay in control</strong><span>Disconnect linked accounts anytime</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="preview" class="section-shell">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="eyebrow">A single, calmer view</div>
          <h2>Know what happened.<br>Know what’s next.</h2>
          <p>Move from today’s balance to the month’s pattern without wrestling a spreadsheet or decoding bank labels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-gallery">
          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-label"><span class="screen-number">01</span><h3>Summary</h3><p>Balances, monthly spend, and recent activity at a glance.</p></div>
            <div class="phone-wrap">
              <div class="phone"><div class="phone-screen"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="FamilyLedger summary screen in English with balance, monthly spending, and recent transactions" /></div></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-label"><span class="screen-number">02</span><h3>Calendar</h3><p>See when spending clusters—and open any day for the details.</p></div>
