    <section class="policy" aria-label="Privacy and support information">
      <div class="container">
        <details>
          <summary>Privacy overview</summary>
          <div class="policy-content">
            <h3>Information FamilyLedger uses</h3><p>Depending on the features you choose, FamilyLedger processes profile information, receipt images and extracted purchase details, manually entered records, linked-bank balances and transactions, and eligible purchase emails.</p>
            <h3>How information is used</h3><p>This information is used to organize spending, calculate summaries, prevent duplicate counting, show family-level activity, and operate connected features. FamilyLedger does not sell personal financial information.</p>
            <h3>Your choices</h3><p>You can disconnect bank and email connections from the app. Household members share spending records needed for the family view, while each person’s linked-account connection details remain private to them.</p>
            <h3>Questions or deletion requests</h3><p>Contact gagebu.support@gmail.com for privacy questions, account deletion, or data access requests.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Bank connection availability</summary>
          <div class="policy-content"><p>Bank connections are provided through Plaid and depend on institution support and institution-specific availability. Some banks may be temporarily unavailable during a migration or maintenance window. Receipt and manual entry features remain available without a bank connection.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
